# ABI v1 open decision 5: what the grow path costs, isolated

arm                         P2.4 ns     P2.4a ns     P2.4b ns  mean(a,b)    excess

# prost's excess is the floor: it has no learned width, so its number is what
# this construction costs on its own. The mechanism's cost is the difference
# between a core arm's excess and prost's.
